file construction/REDS.md the row re-seated onto the current pin, then folded to hold the bound
file construction/archive/REDS-a-bound-is-two-claims-rows-590.md the shelf the row folded to
file construction/archive/20260907-210804_itinerary-landed-accounts.md the elder card block, folded
file construction/ITINERARY.md the lane's live front, cut to fit its ceiling
file session-logs/date/20260907/20260907-210725_the-ceiling-nobody-timed.kyri the parked lap's own record, landed as written
scope Patchouli -- recover a parked lap whole, re-prove it here, re-seat its ledger row from the fetched spine, hold both pins under their bounds
status GREEN -- the row renumbered to %590 on the rebase, keeping its stamp; mantra_weave_merge, mantra_weave_annotate, mantra_weave_merge_control, reds_ledger_monotone, reds_spine_derive and equinox_e123_living_pin_guard all pass on this tree; the hot roster close is named in the reply
recommend keep-going -- apply's uniqueness assert carries the same walk one function over, one loop per insert over every line held, and the sort the merge repair added is already in the file
